# Every pull request requests a review from the maintainers by default.
# Replace OWNER with your GitHub username when you set the repository up,
# and add co-maintainers here as the project grows.
#
# This file only assigns reviewers. It does not block anything on its own —
# see docs/GITHUB-SETUP.md for the branch protection rule that does.

*                       @OWNER

# Areas that benefit from a second pair of eyes, listed separately so that
# co-maintainers can be given ownership of just the part they know well.

/src/70-highlighter.js  @OWNER
/src/50-spoilers.js     @OWNER
/.github/               @OWNER
